# Export HTML (prompt 008 §2, §6): one self-contained file, no script, CSP, images as data: URIs
write-file x1.tmp.md "# Export\n\n## Table\n\n| a | b |\n|---|--:|\n| 1 | 2 |\n\nLocal ![png](../corpus/002/typical-assets/one.png) and remote ![r](https://example.org/r.png).\n\nMath $e^{i\pi}+1=0$ inline.\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TD\nA-->B\n```\n\n- [x] done\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> callout\n\nNote[^1].\n\n[^1]: The note.\n\n<script>alert(1)</script>\n"
open x1.tmp.md
wait-idle
assert document contains x1.tmp.md
export-html x1.tmp.html
assert out_len > 1000
assert out_scripts == 0
assert out_csp == 1
assert out_imgs >= 3
assert out_ext_src == 0
assert out_text contains <!DOCTYPE html>
